750	  /**
751	   * The determined match timeline as a self-describing replay byte stream.
752	   *
753	   * The stream records the format version, the tick configuration, the seed,
754	   * the start frame, the participant identifiers and the initial state hash,
755	   * followed by every confirmed frame with the inputs that were finally
756	   * applied (canonical JSON payloads, kept as raw bytes) and the resulting
757	   * state hash. Frames are committed in strictly ascending tick order, so the
758	   * exported bytes are a pure function of the initial conditions and the final
