838	   *
839	   * Frames after `resumeTick` are discarded and re-derived from the snapshot at
840	   * `resumeTick` plus the stored input records. Every rebuilt frame that already
841	   * existed must keep its hash; a divergence means the log or the engine changed
842	   * and is reported as `integrity_failure` instead of silently changing results.
