- snapshotAt(matchId, N) gives state from stored frame (or initial for 0).
- Verify: recompute stateHash(state) and compare with recorded frame hash at N (frameHashAt). If mismatch → integrity_failure. Also check frame contiguity? For a single snapshot, a "帧缺口" (frame gap) at N means frame N missing → integrity_failure (already handled by snapshotAt/frameHashAt throwing IntegrityError).

