Actually, let me reconsider: maybe rebuild from 0 only when needed. The requirement: "读取历史时需确定性重建并核对记录哈希；遇到帧缺口、哈希不符或差量无法还原快照，整次请求返回 HTTP 409 和 integrity_failure". So yes, deterministic rebuild + hash check required. I'll rebuild from tick 0 (initial state, pure function of config) through tick N, checking each recorded frame hash. This also naturally detects frame gaps (missing frame → integrity error).

